{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Reference clips for backend/evaluation. Audio is NOT in git; point --clips-dir at the folder holding the files named in \"audio\". A truth field that is null is \"no ground truth\": the metric is skipped for that clip, never scored as wrong.",
  "sources": {
    "key": "docs/benchmark/Wilsify_demo_truth.xlsx, SONG_LEVEL_TRUTH \"Key - Ground Truth / Played\"",
